From 4c87faf36913489ce993828c30101bf2a96ac2c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:18:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/15] feat: describe configured video encoding parameters
 accurately

Configure codec profile, GOP, quality, encoding interval and fractional
frame rate in both input formats. Share source and encoder options with
configuration responses and allow explicit sensor dimensions.

Expose H265 through Media2, omit H264 members from JPEG configurations,
and preserve literal percent escapes when formatting stream URLs.
Media1 uses an integer upper bound for fractional frame-rate limits.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
